  "textDump": "Readymag\nSolutions\nPricing\nExamples\nTemplates\nLearn\nLog in\nSign up\nTry Readymag\nDesign and launch outstanding websites\nHello!\nReady\n?\nCompany websites\nLanding pages\nEditorials\nPresentations\nDesign studios\nPortfolios\nTry for free\nor choose your subscription plan\nEnjoy easy workflow\n\nThe intuitive drag-and-drop interface gives you everything you need. \n\nDesigners can switch to Readymag seamlessly, and marketers quickly get used to it.\n\nStreamline teamwork\nAttract with interactivity\n\nInvite co-creators and allow them to either work on the overall web design or just safely tweak the content without affecting the layout. Leave comments, assign tasks and discuss ideas directly in your projects.\n\nAdd multi-step animations, custom cursors, shadows, slideshows, galleries and hotspots and make objects draggable. Embed videos, make loops, play and pause with animation triggers.\n\nExpand functionality to infinity \n\nIntegrate services, plugins, and widgets; add forms, allow booking and payments, enable HTML, JavaScript and CSS code for styles. You can export the site code or embed your website into another project.\n\nGet the best support \nKnow your audience\n\nIntegrate services, plugins, and widgets; add forms, allow booking and payments, enable HTML, JavaScript and CSS code for styles. You can export the site code or embed your website into another project.\n\nAdd analytics tracking codes to learn more about your audience and reach them via different channels. Easily launch landing pages for ad campaigns—and collect leads.\n\nOur agents offer around-the-clock support on business days and treat \nyou with care.\n\nTeams of all sizes create websites with Readymag\ncompany\nabout\ncareers\nreviews\nterms of service\nprivacy policy\ncookie policy\nproduct\npricing\ntemplates\nproduct updates\naffiliate program\nreferral program\nnpo discount\nforum\nstatus\nhelp\ncase studies\nexamples\nfreelancers\nagencies\nstudents\ncompanies\